Licences of the Rust crates in this build of Automatic
======================================================

cargo-about wrote this file from Cargo.lock, for this build's platform. It
lists every Rust crate used to build the app, grouped by licence text. That
includes crates used only while building. A crate that bundles a C library is
listed under that library's licence too.

Each crate's source is at the crates.io address beside its name.

The other files in this folder cover the interface's npm packages, the
material Automatic adapts or vendors, and on Linux the system libraries the
AppImage carries (in THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md).

